  "prompt": "# Core Summary\nA cinematic 5-second realistic confrontation between two middle-aged men in a bright, high-contrast environment, structured as a two-shot progression. Shot 1 establishes ID_A with a camera arc from behind to profile as he asks a cold question. Shot 2 cuts to ID_B who aggressively points and shouts confirmation, creating a tense micro-arc of challenge and accusation.\n\n# Scene\n[shot1][00:00-00:02] Outdoor industrial or open concrete space, bright daylight with strong directional shadows casting depth. Background slightly out of focus to emphasize foreground subject. High-contrast lighting with rim light on hair.\n[shot2][00:02-00:05] Environment identical to shot1, camera angle shifted 90 degrees right to face ID_B. Background shows blurred structural elements consistent with the first shot's location. Lighting remains bright with deep shadows to accentuate facial contours.\n\n# Subjects Description\n<ID_A>: Male, East Asian, middle-aged (45-50). Long flowing hair mixed black and white, unkempt stubble beard. Wears dark, textured clothing. Sharp, cold facial features.\n<ID_B>: Male, East Asian, middle-aged (35-40). Shorter hair, clean-shaven but with a sinister expression. Wears slightly more formal but disheveled attire. Cunning eyes, fierce expression.\n**Vocal Characteristics**: ID_A has a deep, calm, slightly raspy voice. ID_B has a loud, aggressive, sharp shouting voice.\n\n# Dynamic Narrative\n[shot1][00:00-00:02] Camera starts behind <ID_A>'s left shoulder, quickly arcs right to reveal his side profile. <ID_A> stands still, wind blowing his long black-and-white hair slightly. His gaze is cold and fixed forward. <ID_A> (calm, cold) says: [00:00-00:01]「我错了吗」. The camera movement settles on his profile as he finishes the line.\n[shot2][00:02-00:05] Camera cuts to <ID_B> facing left, positioned opposite <ID_A>. <ID_B> steps forward slightly, eyes narrowing with cunning intensity. He raises his right hand, pointing a finger aggressively toward <ID_A>. <ID_B> (aggressive, shouting) says: [00:02-00:04]「对，你错了，错了？」. His facial muscles tense, mouth open wide in a shout, expression fierce and狰狞 (ferocious). The shot holds on his accusing gesture until the end.\n\n# Style, Color & Aesthetics\nRealistic live-action cinematic style, high resolution, 16:9 aspect ratio. Color palette is natural but with enhanced contrast, emphasizing cool tones for <ID_A> and warmer, harsher tones for <ID_B>. Lighting is bright with deep, sculpted shadows (chiaroscuro effect) to highlight the tension and facial textures. Depth of field is shallow to isolate characters from the background.\n\n# Atmosphere & Emotion\nTense, confrontational, and dramatic. The atmosphere is heavy with unspoken conflict, driven by the stark contrast between <ID_A>'s calm resignation and <ID_B>'s aggressive accusation. The short duration creates a punchy, impactful feeling of immediate conflict.",
